WEBVTT

00:00:10.192 --> 00:00:11.585
[ALL SNORING]

00:00:20.594 --> 00:00:21.725
[SIGHS]

00:00:23.553 --> 00:00:25.033
[DISTANT ANIMAL CALLS]

00:00:31.213 --> 00:00:32.780
[SNARLING]

00:00:41.745 --> 00:00:43.747
[LOUD ANIMAL CALLS]

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:56.935
[GASPS]

00:00:57.544 --> 00:00:58.545
[SNIFFING]

00:01:00.634 --> 00:01:01.635
[GASPS]

00:01:15.344 --> 00:01:16.345
[GASPS]

00:01:20.262 --> 00:01:21.437
[GRUNTS]

00:01:35.321 --> 00:01:36.322
[COUGHS]

00:01:42.632 --> 00:01:43.895
[SHUDDERS]

00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:45.070
[THUD]
[GASPS]

00:01:57.996 --> 00:01:59.040
[GASPS]

00:02:09.311 --> 00:02:10.530
[GRUNTS]

00:02:26.459 --> 00:02:27.851
[TWIG SNAPS]
[GASPS]

00:02:34.206 --> 00:02:35.598
[GRUNTS]
[THUD]

00:02:39.167 --> 00:02:40.516
[GRUNTING]

00:02:45.869 --> 00:02:47.001
[GROWLS]

00:02:49.351 --> 00:02:50.657
[GASPS]

00:03:21.253 --> 00:03:22.341
[SNIFFS]

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:40.315
Huh?

00:03:44.667 --> 00:03:45.668
[GASPS]

00:03:50.934 --> 00:03:52.023
[GRUNTS]

00:03:53.067 --> 00:03:54.286
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:58.681
[GRUNTS]

00:04:09.214 --> 00:04:10.389
[GRUNTS]

00:04:10.432 --> 00:04:11.520
[SCREAMING]

00:04:13.044 --> 00:04:14.654
[MUFFLED SCREAMING]
[SHUSHES]

00:04:15.872 --> 00:04:16.917
Ow!

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.484
[GASPING]

00:04:18.527 --> 00:04:19.659
[RASPING] Air.

00:04:19.702 --> 00:04:21.226
You talk.

00:04:21.269 --> 00:04:23.402
I'm a person,
like you.

00:04:23.445 --> 00:04:24.533
[GRUNTS]

00:04:25.665 --> 00:04:28.102
Sort of like you.

00:04:28.146 --> 00:04:29.625
Hmm. [SNIFFING]

00:04:30.844 --> 00:04:32.106
Okay, okay.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:33.325
Hey, hey, hey!

00:04:33.368 --> 00:04:34.848
Would you mind not--

00:04:34.891 --> 00:04:35.892
[YELPING]

00:04:37.024 --> 00:04:38.678
[GIGGLING]
That tickles.

00:04:38.721 --> 00:04:40.245
Hey, hey, hey!

00:04:40.288 --> 00:04:41.420
[CHITTERS]

00:04:41.463 --> 00:04:42.812
Ah!
Ow!

00:04:42.856 --> 00:04:44.336
[GROANS] Wow!
[WHISPERS] Quiet!

00:04:44.379 --> 00:04:46.599
I'm not supposed
to be out here.

00:04:46.642 --> 00:04:47.643
Ow!

00:04:47.991 --> 00:04:48.992
Oh!

00:04:49.993 --> 00:04:51.169
[BOTH GRUNTING]

00:04:55.738 --> 00:04:56.870
[GASPS]

00:04:59.307 --> 00:05:00.439
Eep is gone.

00:05:00.482 --> 00:05:01.701
What? Grug!

00:05:01.744 --> 00:05:02.832
Stay in the cave.

00:05:03.616 --> 00:05:04.704
[GRUNTS]

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.711
[EXHALES]

00:05:14.061 --> 00:05:16.150
Wow.
You are really strong.

00:05:19.371 --> 00:05:20.981
Hey! No! It's mine.

00:05:21.024 --> 00:05:22.809
Please! Wait.
No!

00:05:22.852 --> 00:05:24.680
It's dying! I can fix it!
No! I caught it!

00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:26.247
Please! Please.

00:05:26.291 --> 00:05:27.727
I hate the dark.

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:28.771
[GASPS]

